  "content": "<a href=\"/\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M257.5 445.1l-22.2 22.2c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 273c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.4 44.7c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.2 22.2c9.5 9.5 9.3 25-.4 34.3L136.6 216H424c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v32c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24H136.6l120.5 114.8c9.8 9.3 10 24.8.4 34.3z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Project &gt;</p><p>Newtriens App Design</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Newtriens App Design</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"8\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Overview: </b>Newtriens is a comprehensive health platform designed to bridge the gap between nutrition tracking and meal procurement. Unlike standard diet apps that only track data, Newtriens integrates food ordering, calorie monitoring, and professional consultation into a single, cohesive user experience.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"10\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Challenge (Problem): </b>Users often struggle to maintain healthy habits due to \"App Fatigue\" tracking calories in one app, ordering food in another, and browsing articles elsewhere is overwhelming. The disconnection between <i data-path-to-node=\"11,0\" data-index-in-node=\"200\">planning</i> a diet and <i data-path-to-node=\"11,0\" data-index-in-node=\"220\">getting</i> the food leads to low user retention and abandoned health goals.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"12\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Solution (Design Decision): </b>I designed a unified ecosystem to reduce friction and cognitive load:</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"13,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Smart Integration:</b> Created a user flow where ordering food automatically updates the daily calorie tracker, eliminating tedious manual data entry.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Creator Economy Model:</b> Designed the \"Article Hub\" not just as a blog, but as a monetization platform where health experts can write and earn, ensuring a steady stream of high-quality content.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Empathetic UI:</b> Utilized ample whitespace and calming color palettes to prevent users from feeling overwhelmed by nutritional numbers.</p></li></ul>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🔗Link</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.figma.com/proto/YyT2kVrbo0TPE1XlhkJEAr/Untitled?node-id=1-75759&#038;starting-point-node-id=1%3A5993&#038;t=oucx2MyzFXlYbF5k-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLive Demo\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"febec45\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"9\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3MywidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzktMS5wbmciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiJmZWJlYzQ1In0%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/9-1.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/9-1.png\" alt=\"9\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"febec45\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"10\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3NCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzEwLTEucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiZmViZWM0NSJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/10-1.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/10-1.png\" alt=\"10\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"febec45\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"11\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3NSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzExLTEucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiZmViZWM0NSJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/11-1.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/11-1.png\" alt=\"11\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"febec45\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"12\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3NiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzEyLTEucG5nIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiZmViZWM0NSJ9\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/12-1.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/12-1.png\" alt=\"12\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"febec45\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"13\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3OCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzEzLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImZlYmVjNDUifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/13.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/13.png\" alt=\"13\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"febec45\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"14\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI5MSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzE0LnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImZlYmVjNDUifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/14.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/14.png\" alt=\"14\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"febec45\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"15\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI5MiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzE1LnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImZlYmVjNDUifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/15.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/15.png\" alt=\"15\" /></figure></a>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Result: </b>A high-fidelity, validated prototype that simplifies the user journey from \"planning\" to \"eating,\" ready for full-stack development.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🧩 <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Topic Area</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHealth &amp; Wellness\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFood &amp; Nutrition\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMedical Consultation\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🛠️ <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\">Skills Used</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tFigma (UI design and prototyping)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tUX Research and User Testing\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tTeam Collaboration and Communication\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tUser Experience (UX) Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tGraphic Design Principles\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🎯 Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<ul><li data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"258\"><p data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"258\"><strong data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"163\">Smart Meal Ordering:</strong> Browse and order healthy food with complete calorie and nutrition information for each item.</p></li><li data-start=\"259\" data-end=\"362\"><p data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"362\"><strong data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"281\">Calorie Tracker:</strong> Monitor daily calorie intake and stay aligned with your fitness or diet goals.</p></li><li data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"482\"><p data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"482\"><strong data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"381\">Article Hub:</strong> Read and publish health-related articles, with opportunities to earn income from your own content.</p></li><li data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"598\"><p data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"598\"><strong data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"509\">Health Consultation:</strong> Book one-on-one consultations with doctors or nutritionists for personalized guidance.</p></li><li data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"715\"><p data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"715\"><strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"629\">User-Friendly Interface:</strong> Clean, intuitive design built to encourage healthy habits without overwhelming users.</p></li></ul>"
